        "content": "## Workflow B - Incident documentation (Agent 2)\nThe backend builds a versioned technical report (Markdown/HTML, printable to PDF) from stored evidence: scope, thresholds, baseline, adjacent rooms, virtual-sensor values with uncertainty, related incidents and timeline. Re-running on an unchanged incident is a no-op (content hash).\n\nValid output -> Workflow C.",
        "color": 6,
        "width": 860,
        "height": 200
      }
    }
